  "instructions": [
    "Season the pork bones with salt and black pepper, then sous-vide at 80°C for 2 hours.",
    "While the pork bones are cooking, combine the pork shoulder, chashu pork belly, and sliced green onions in a bowl.",
    "In a large pot, combine the pork bones, garlic, and water. Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 2 hours.",
    "Strain the broth through a fine-mesh sieve into a clean pot, discarding the solids.",
    "Add the miso paste and soy sauce to the broth and whisk until dissolved.",
    "Add the pork shoulder mixture to the pot and cook for 2-3 minutes, or until heated through.",
    "Season the broth with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "To serve, place noodles in a bowl, then ladle the hot broth and pork mixture over the top.",
    "Garnish with toasted sesame seeds, sesame oil, and sliced green onions.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
